<title>MOLDOVA: TABLE - Moldovan leu steady at 4.588 per dollar.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Moldovan leu steady at 4.588 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu remained steady at 4.588 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from the previous auction on Aug 15.</p>
<p>				   Aug 18     Aug 15</p>
<p> lei per dollar		4.588	4.588</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	   300,000    280,000</p>
